# Force of Vigor, two targets: when one becomes illegal before it resolves, the spell still does what it can to the other
# (CR 608.2b). Bot2 casts it on Bot1's turn 1 for its alternative cost (exiling the Elvish Mystic), targeting Black Lotus
# and Mox Sapphire; Bot1 answers by tapping the Black Lotus for mana, which sacrifices it, so only the Mox Sapphire
# is destroyed by the spell (Bot1's Lotus is in the graveyard because it was sacrificed, not destroyed).

